{
  "file_id": "3565",
  "text_count": 32,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Really? Well, anyway, let's head\nhome.",
      "_offset": 21,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 60,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Oh, right. Mommy, let's go this\nway today!",
      "_offset": 66,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Huh? Why?",
      "_offset": 109,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "I heard there's a shortcut this\nway.",
      "_offset": 119,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Huh, okay! It's nice to take\nanother route once in a while.",
      "_offset": 156,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "It's nice to take another route\nonce in a while.",
      "_offset": 216,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "What should I make for tonight's\ndinner?",
      "_offset": 265,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'm fine with whatever! I like\nanything you make, Mommy.",
      "_offset": 306,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Hey! Found you!",
      "_offset": 363,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "A... a talking spider?! Ah!",
      "_offset": 379,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Mama!",
      "_offset": 408,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "It's Dokugumon! Takeru, get down!\nOops, I talked...",
      "_offset": 414,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "It's okay, Patamon, it looks like\nMommy fainted.",
      "_offset": 466,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Mommy hates spiders even more than\nshe hates cockroaches.",
      "_offset": 515,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Hey, hey, Chosen Child! Gimme your\nTag and Crest!",
      "_offset": 573,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "I'm gonna protect Takeru and his\nmom!",
      "_offset": 623,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "U...gh...",
      "_offset": 661,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Mama!",
      "_offset": 671,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Takeru! W-where's that spider\nmonster?",
      "_offset": 677,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Monster? There was a spider, but\nit was just a normal spider.",
      "_offset": 716,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Huh?! But it was the size of a\nperson...",
      "_offset": 778,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "You must have thought it was\nbigger out of shock. It's okay, \nI grabbed it and threw it away.",
      "_offset": 819,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "(Maybe *I'm* the one who's worn\nout, not Takeru...)",
      "_offset": 913,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yeah...Yeah, you're right, giant\nspiders don't exist.",
      "_offset": 965,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Right! Anyway, let's hurry up and\ngo home. I have so much to tell\nyou about camp.",
      "_offset": 1019,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Yeah! Let's go home.",
      "_offset": 1101,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "You seemed a lot more mature just\nnow. Maybe because of camp?",
      "_offset": 1122,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I grew up a little!",
      "_offset": 1184,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "And just what do you mean by that?",
      "_offset": 1204,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Right, Patamon?",
      "_offset": 1239,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "(Right, Takeru!)",
      "_offset": 1255,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}